    "@type": "ScholarlyArticle",
    "name": "the_fourteen_hash_bits_read_back_from_the_fourth_group",
    "description": "∀ b8 b9 : Nat, b8 < 256 → b9 < 256 → ((or8 (and8 b8 63) 128) * 256 + b9) / 16384 = 2 ∧ ((or8 (and8 b8 63) 128) * 256 + b9) % 16384 = b8 % 64 * 256 + b9",
    "identifier": "lean_address_the_fourteen_hash_bits_read_back_from_the_fourth_group",
    "url": "https://ceccec.psg.bg/millennium-solutions/theorem/lean_address_the_fourteen_hash_bits_read_back_from_the_fourth_group",
